      "kind": "fact",
      "statement": {
        "zh": "已登记晚古风文献强调无陶，并报告建筑、垃圾、植物遗存与碳十四；未报道文字或泥板行政。",
        "en": "Registered Late Archaic literature emphasizes aceramic assemblages and reports architecture, refuse, botanical remains, and radiocarbon; no writing or tablet administration reported."
      },
