      "id": "claim-andes-coast-valley-interaction",
      "kind": "fact",
      "statement": {
        "zh": "内陆粪便中出现海洋蛋白并与灌溉/玉米证据并存，支持区域内海岸—河谷互动，不等于已证明长途贸易路线图。",
        "en": "Marine protein in inland coprolites alongside irrigation/maize evidence supports intra-regional coast–valley interaction, not a mapped long-distance trade system."
      },
